# Contributing

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
. .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## Checks

Run the full suite before opening a pull request:

```bash
python -m ruff check .
python -m mypy
python -m pytest
```

Coverage must stay at 100% of branches, and skipped tests are rejected in CI.
A change without tests for new behavior will not pass the gate.

## Pull requests

- Keep each change focused and describe why it is needed.
- Update `README.md` when user-facing behavior changes.
- Write commit messages and documentation in English.
